<title>RUSSIA: Rouble falls to 5,365 per dlr in Moscow.</title>
<headline>Rouble falls to 5,365 per dlr in Moscow.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1996-09-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The rouble fell to 5,365 to the dollar on the Moscow Interbank Currency Exchange (MICEX) from 5,352 on Monday.</p>
<p>				    Sept 3		  Sept 2</p>
<p> Dollar rate		    5,365		   5,352</p>
<p> Volume traded (million $)	22.82		   14.34</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
